 then forced into further long-term  arcs that only went on to highlight  their lack of anything we'll each live  this new portion of its life on  character design alone which is a huge  credit to tee takubo he is definitely  one hell of an artist to continually  come up with such compelling designs  that he was no writer so as cool as  these characters look most of them  amount to nothing in the long run and  that is the tragedy of bleach a series  extended far beyond what its characters  world story and even author could  support it suffered a slow and  humiliating death not only falling from  the graces of anime and manga but being  kicked into the dirt which is a shame  because I used to love bleach even with  all the flaws I've mentioned everything  up until the end of Soul Society was  enough to captivate me as a teenager and  knowing where it eventually ended up  does hurt me somewhat as much as one day  I do want to go through the rest of the  series part of me just wants to leave  things as they are and maintain a strong  memory of the golden years this series  gave me moments that I will never forget  and for that I would like to thank Tito  Kubo and Shu Asia for allowing me that  in the first place  so no matter where you ended up here's  to the memory of bleach but that pretty  much does it for this discussion on  where did bleach go wrong if you enjoyed  this video and the content this channel  produce in general then please do  consider donating to the New World  review patreon because the support of  all of you amazing people is what  continues to make this channel possible  and of patreon isn't quite your style  then please do leave this video like  share or subscribe because it also helps  support this channel an incredible  amount and if you'd like to join the fun  at any time then please do head over to  my discord server where a wide array of  shenanigan re takes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment with  your thoughts on where b